        "original_id": "1136e6cc-7fc4-5bfb-8fa3-d135278bb218",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: Miss USA 1968\n- People: Bob Barker\n- Organizations: CBS\n- Places: Miami Beach, Florida\n- Products: The Price Is Right, Truth or Consequences\n\nFacts:\n- Miss USA 1968 was the 17th Miss USA pageant and was televised live by CBS from Miami Beach, Florida on May 18, 1968.\n- Bob Barker hosted Miss USA 1968 on May 18, 1968.\n- Bob Barker hosted Truth or Consequences from 1956 to 1974.\n- Bob Barker hosted CBS's The Price Is Right from 1972 to 2007.\n- The Price Is Right became the longest-running daytime game show in North American television history.",
